  "title": "802.11: Avoid overflow on unknown PV if FCS is reported on short frame",
  "description": "If the reported length is too short, don't subtract the FCS length from\nthe reported length before handing to the data dissector, which would\nwrap. Throw an exception when trying to add the missing checksum.\n\nCoverity CID 1543203",
